---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing — The Oracles"
  description="How pricing works at The Oracles: every project quoted on its own, with a first-project offer. Tell us what you need and we'll give you one clear number."
  path="/pricing"
>
  <section class="vhero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
    <h1 class="vhero__title">Simple and <span class="accent">honest.</span></h1>
    <p class="vhero__sub">
      Every project is quoted on its own, but most are built from two pieces:
      a shoot day and an edit.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule-top">
    <h2 class="h2">Cost to <span class="accent">shoot</span></h2>
    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">Full day shoot</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$1,400</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">Up to 8 hours on-site</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>+ 2 hrs prep &amp; travel per crew member</li>
          <li>Camera and lighting included</li>
          <li>DP and Director on-site</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">Half day shoot</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$1,000</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">Up to 4 hours on-site</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>+ 2 hrs prep &amp; travel per crew member</li>
          <li>Camera and lighting included</li>
          <li>DP and Director on-site</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">AI production day</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$800</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">A shoot day, generated</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>For footage a camera can&rsquo;t get — or a budget can&rsquo;t fly to</li>
          <li>Generation &amp; model costs included</li>
          <li>Director-guided, story-first</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule-top">
    <h2 class="h2">Create your <span class="accent">content</span></h2>
    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">Single edit</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$600</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">One story-driven video</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>Roughly 12 hours of editing</li>
          <li>Copyright-cleared music &amp; sound</li>
          <li>One story, cut to land</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">Social edits (×3)</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$200</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">Three short cuts</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>3 hrs editing + 1 hr director review</li>
          <li>Sized for social</li>
          <li>Same story, made to scroll</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule-top">
    <h2 class="h2">Other <span class="accent">services</span></h2>
    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card">
        <p class="price-card__label">Equipment rental</p>
        <p class="price-card__price">$500</p>
        <p class="price-card__unit">Per day, gear only</p>
        <ul class="price-card__list">
          <li>Camera package — $350</li>
          <li>Lighting package — $150</li>
          <li>The same kit our shoot days carry</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">
      Every project adds a flat $100 production overhead (music, AI tools,
      cloud, and storage) covering typical usage, itemized on every invoice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule-top">
    <p class="lead measure">
      Something outside these packages? We&rsquo;ll gladly build a quote made
      for your project, and ad-hoc work is billed at $50 an hour.
    </p>
    <p class="lead measure" style="margin-top:1rem;">
      Don&rsquo;t see your project? Be the first story we tell in your world and
      your first project is half price. Either way, the best next step is to
      reach out.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn"><span>/ Let&rsquo;s talk</span><span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
